<import src="../../templates/state.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="state" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{site}}"><view class="h1">{{section==='privacy'?'隐私与服务说明':'关于我们'}}</view><view class="h2">运营主体</view><view class="intro">江苏黄桥乐器文化产业园投资发展有限公司</view><view class="intro pre-line">{{site.intro}}</view><view class="h2">服务说明</view><view class="intro pre-line">{{site.serviceNote}}</view><view class="h2">资料使用与隐私说明</view><view class="intro pre-line">{{site.privacy}}</view><view wx:if="{{site.address}}" class="panel">地址：{{site.address}}</view><button wx:if="{{site.phone}}" class="secondary" bindtap="phone">电话咨询</button><button bindtap="consult">联系咨询</button><view class="support-note">如需查询、更正或删除已提交资料，请联系工作人员。</view></block></view>
